#: manual/api/backend/js.md:1
msgid "backend/js API"
msgstr ""

#: manual/api/backend/js.md:3
msgid "The package `Luna-Flow/luna_thread/backend/js`, imported as `@js`, is the placeholder for the JavaScript backend. It names its target and nothing more: it declares no foreign functions and executes nothing. It builds on every target."
msgstr ""

