msgid "Returns the sum of the elements, or `0` on any failure."
msgstr ""

#: manual/api/backend/native.md:80
msgid "The kernel adds each chunk from the left and then adds the chunk sums from the left, failing when any of these partial sums overflows. A returned non-zero value is the exact sum; `0` is either the sum or a failure."
